stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> PendingSetup
  PendingSetup --> Active: S1 first payment and renewal setup succeeded
  PendingSetup --> Cancelled: S2 setup abandoned or failed
  Active --> PastDue: S3 renewal payment failed
  PastDue --> Active: S4 retry or manual payment succeeded
  PastDue --> Paused: S5 retries exhausted
  Active --> Paused: S6 customer pauses
  Paused --> Active: S7 customer resumes and period is paid
  Active --> CancelPending: S8 customer cancels
  Paused --> CancelPending: S8 customer cancels
  PastDue --> CancelPending: S8 customer cancels
  CancelPending --> Cancelled: S9 committed deliveries finished
  Active --> Completed: S10 fixed term ended (only if plans have a term)
